                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">BackingStoreException</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
Thrown to indicate that a preferences operation could not complete because of
 a failure in the backing store, or a failure to contact the backing store.
   </fo:block>
