                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">NullPointerException</fo:inline>– if {@code key} is {@code null}. (A
         {@code null} value for {@code def} <fo:inline font-style="italic">is </fo:inline> permitted.)</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
